	(descr "Keystone 5153 compact four-leg keypad dome, 10 mm, 0.65 mm high. The dome is placed on the pads, not soldered: no paste. Pad 1 is the center contact, pad 2 the legs. The courtyard follows the dome and the leg pads. https://www.irwin-ind.com/articlebanner/pdfs/keystone/5153TR.PDF")
